{"page":319,"width":1680,"height":2358,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"히프는 여러 개의 값들 중에서 가상 큰 값이나 가상 작은 값-을 빠르게 찾아내도록 만들어진 자","words":[{"text":"히프는","x":187,"y":192,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"여러","x":282,"y":192,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"개의","x":347,"y":193,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"값들","x":410,"y":192,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"중에서","x":472,"y":194,"width":76,"height":32},{"text":"가상","x":562,"y":194,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"큰","x":622,"y":196,"width":26,"height":28},{"text":"값이나","x":659,"y":192,"width":77,"height":32},{"text":"가상","x":747,"y":193,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"작은","x":807,"y":193,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"값-을","x":869,"y":192,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"빠르게","x":929,"y":192,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"찾아내도록","x":1018,"y":192,"width":134,"height":31},{"text":"만들어진","x":1162,"y":192,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"자","x":1278,"y":192,"width":27,"height":32}]},{"text":"료 구조이다. 히프는 간단히 말하면 부모 노드의 기 값이 자식 노드의 기 값보다 항상 큰 이진 트","words":[{"text":"료","x":155,"y":250,"width":27,"height":24},{"text":"구조이다.","x":192,"y":246,"width":120,"height":32},{"text":"히프는","x":327,"y":247,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"간단히","x":417,"y":246,"width":76,"height":32},{"text":"말하면","x":506,"y":247,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"부모","x":594,"y":246,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"노드의","x":656,"y":245,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"기","x":746,"y":245,"width":21,"height":31},{"text":"값이","x":781,"y":245,"width":47,"height":31},{"text":"자식","x":840,"y":244,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"노드의","x":902,"y":244,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"기","x":992,"y":244,"width":20,"height":31},{"text":"값보다","x":1027,"y":243,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"항상","x":1115,"y":244,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"큰","x":1178,"y":246,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"이진","x":1216,"y":244,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"트","x":1279,"y":247,"width":25,"height":23}]},{"text":"리를 말한다. 히프는 부모 노드와 자식 노드 간에 다음과 같은 조건이 항상 성립하는 트리이다.","words":[{"text":"리를","x":157,"y":300,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"말한다.","x":221,"y":300,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"히프는","x":326,"y":301,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"부모","x":416,"y":300,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"노드와","x":478,"y":300,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"자식","x":567,"y":299,"width":49,"height":33},{"text":"노드","x":628,"y":302,"width":52,"height":24},{"text":"간에","x":690,"y":298,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"다음과","x":752,"y":297,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"같은","x":840,"y":297,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"조건이","x":900,"y":296,"width":74,"height":32},{"text":"항상","x":986,"y":296,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"성립하는","x":1050,"y":296,"width":105,"height":32},{"text":"트리이다.","x":1165,"y":296,"width":113,"height":31}]},{"text":"/?e!/(부뾰「의 ) keⅨ자식노드)","words":[{"text":"/?e!/(부뾰「의","x":250,"y":406,"width":179,"height":36},{"text":")","x":445,"y":410,"width":21,"height":25},{"text":"keⅨ자식노드)","x":480,"y":405,"width":172,"height":35}]},{"text":"예를 들어 다음과 같은 트리가 히프이다. 히프트리에서는 중복된 값을 허용한에 유의하라. 이","words":[{"text":"예를","x":189,"y":518,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"들어","x":256,"y":518,"width":52,"height":33},{"text":"다음과","x":323,"y":516,"width":81,"height":34},{"text":"같은","x":415,"y":516,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"트리가","x":478,"y":515,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"히프이다.","x":569,"y":513,"width":110,"height":34},{"text":"히프트리에서는","x":694,"y":511,"width":182,"height":33},{"text":"중복된","x":886,"y":510,"width":77,"height":33},{"text":"값을","x":975,"y":510,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"허용한에","x":1037,"y":509,"width":104,"height":33},{"text":"유의하라.","x":1153,"y":509,"width":114,"height":31},{"text":"이","x":1282,"y":509,"width":22,"height":31}]},{"text":"진 탐색 트리에서는 중복된 값을 허용하지 않았었다.","words":[{"text":"진","x":159,"y":572,"width":24,"height":30},{"text":"탐색","x":194,"y":572,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"트리에서는","x":260,"y":572,"width":139,"height":32},{"text":"중복된","x":408,"y":569,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"값을","x":498,"y":569,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"허용하지","x":561,"y":568,"width":101,"height":32},{"text":"않았었다.","x":675,"y":567,"width":110,"height":32}]},{"text":"7","words":[{"text":"7","x":337,"y":791,"width":13,"height":20}]},{"text":"0","words":[{"text":"0","x":266,"y":825,"width":21,"height":22}]},{"text":"5","words":[{"text":"5","x":237,"y":887,"width":13,"height":19}]},{"text":"[그림 9-5] 히프트리의 예","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":161,"y":1064,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"9-5]","x":223,"y":1062,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"히프트리의","x":293,"y":1065,"width":107,"height":24},{"text":"예","x":410,"y":1065,"width":19,"height":24}]},{"text":"9","words":[{"text":"9","x":531,"y":691,"width":13,"height":21}]},{"text":"4","words":[{"text":"4","x":435,"y":885,"width":15,"height":19}]},{"text":"6","words":[{"text":"6","x":725,"y":787,"width":13,"height":20}]},{"text":"3","words":[{"text":"3","x":631,"y":884,"width":12,"height":20}]},{"text":"2","words":[{"text":"2","x":820,"y":882,"width":12,"height":20}]},{"text":"다른 용어로 이야기하면 히프 안에서 데이터들은 느슨한 정렬 상태를 유지한다. 즉 큰 값이 상","words":[{"text":"다른","x":193,"y":1170,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"용어로","x":256,"y":1169,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"이야기하면","x":351,"y":1169,"width":134,"height":31},{"text":"히프","x":496,"y":1169,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"안에서","x":558,"y":1167,"width":75,"height":32},{"text":"데이터들은","x":646,"y":1167,"width":130,"height":31},{"text":"느슨한","x":785,"y":1165,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"정렬","x":874,"y":1165,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"상태를","x":935,"y":1166,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"유지한다.","x":1025,"y":1165,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"즉","x":1150,"y":1165,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"큰","x":1187,"y":1166,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"값이","x":1224,"y":1163,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"상","x":1287,"y":1163,"width":28,"height":31}]},{"text":"위 레벨에 있고 작은 값이 하위 레벨에 있다는 정도이다. 히프의 목적은 삭제 연산이 수행될 때","words":[{"text":"위","x":163,"y":1223,"width":23,"height":30},{"text":"레벨에","x":201,"y":